message: "If you use RadHydropy in your research, please cite it using this file."
title: RadHydropy
type: software
version: 0.1.0a1
abstract: >-
  A one-dimensional finite-volume hydrodynamics package for Cartesian and
  spherical test problems, with support for gravity, thermo-chemistry,
  radiative transfer, cosmological coordinates, and HDF5 snapshots.
